WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:04.220
Quickler is the data processor, and you are the data controller.

2
00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:08.460
That means all the data you generate on Quickler is yours, and you

3
00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:10.820
can take control of it whenever you like.

4
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:15.560
In Settings, scroll to the bottom of the page, click Download Data,

5
00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:17.340
and press Prepare Download.

6
00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:21.540
Quickler then puts everything together in one file, with all the

7
00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:24.820
records in every format, including all the photos and messages.

8
00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:29.000
When it's ready, you'll receive a download link by email.

9
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.060
If you want to delete all your data from Quickler, simply contact

10
00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:34.480
deletedata@quickler.

11
00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:36.320
co with your details.
